# Claude Code local state + agent git worktrees (never commit; their __tests__
# otherwise pollute local `vitest` with phantom duplicate-file failures).
# settings.json is the exception: it carries the DESIGN.md forbidden-skill
# lock, which is worthless if every machine has to re-create it by hand.
# Ignore the CONTENTS, not the directory, so the negation below can apply.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json

# Temporary audit/build artifacts and local Supabase CLI state
.tmp-*
supabase/.temp/
scripts/strip-mfa-factors.mjs
